  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "When using the new distance hiding feature in the beta, you can sometimes see the diamond of players who are blocking you.\nThis can be reliably reproduced by setting your the distance hiding to \"Hide All Avatars Except Me\" and then joining an instance that contains someone who has blocked you.\nIt corrects itself if you change the setting and they get into range where they would normally be unhid.\nIt does not make them appear in the menu, nor is their nameplate or player capsule present. Not a huge issue and it's a bug that only shows itself under these quite specific circumstances, but I figured it should be reported anyway.\nThanks.",
